 "description": "With the Oceanis 42, we are opening up a new chapter in the strategic 40-foot segment. As the successor of the Oceanis 40.1, this model represents a more refined and customisable generation, with a choice of five layout options.\nThe Oceanis 42 is opening a new chapter.\nThe synthesis of our French craftsmanship.",
