  {
   "kind": "interior-design",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "Natural light attracts the eye. Generous volumes. The atmosphere is elegant, contemporary, and sophisticated.\nThe interior upholstery is Premium, with three distinct styles: Ivory, sober and classic; Sunset, very cozy; Pacific, refreshing and timeless.\nAlways driven by attention to detail, the sand-coloured oak finishes add a touch of warmth and modernity. The 2-mm-thick wood edges enhance the feeling of quality and sophistication to the touch. Every detail has been carefully crafted in order to create a sophisticated and timeless atmosphere.\nThe saloon is spacious, bright, and designed for welcoming guests. Facing it, a full-size desk structures the owner's area. We have also incorporated a bookshelf on the mast foot bulkhead, as well as a cabinet at the base of the companionway containing all of the boat’s electrical controls. This ensures clear and efficient organisation of the onboard systems.\nThe Oceanis 42 is designed for a comfortable lifestyle on board.",
   "items": [],
