  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Design",
   "intro": "The Oceanis 42 redefines the modern 40-foot yacht and establishes herself as the benchmark: safe, convivial and smart.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Unprecedented modularity",
     "text": "The Oceanis 42 is the only 40-foot boat on the market that provides five layout options.\nShe is also the only one that offers two different interior layouts: one version with an L-shaped galley, and one version with a linear galley featuring a large working surface."
    },
    {
     "title": "High performance and control, by Lombard",
     "text": "To further enhance performance under sail, we have increased the sail area: The standard furling mast is now 60 cm taller, while the classic and performance masts are both 30 cm taller. This development offers greater power without compromising accessibility and control."
    },
    {
     "title": "A real seafaring galley",
     "text": "Located at the foot of the companionway, the L-shaped galley asserts its nautical style. Stable when heeling, it provides a sense of security during navigation and remains connected with the cockpit.\nWith a cooling capacity of 215 litres, it offers the largest cooling volume in the 40-foot boat segment."
    }
   ],
