  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "40 Years of French-Made Icons",
   "intro": "To mark its 40th anniversary, the Oceanis range reaffirms its commitment to French expertise, that has shaped its identity since the creation of the brand. This new model is a continuation of that commitment, driven by the know-how of our teams and by French workforce manufacturing. Forty years after the launch of the first Oceanis, most of the range is still manufactured in France. This reflects our enduring commitment to French industrial expertise and boat construction.",
   "items": [],
